<cover_body:list>
Write exactly three concise cover-letter body paragraphs for the {{ job_ref.title }} role at {{ job_ref.company }}.

Use only evidence supplied by JAW from {{ user }}, {{ work_exp }}, {{ cap }}, and {{ job_ref }}. Do not invent experience, metrics, certifications, technologies, employers, or job requirements.

Paragraph 1: explain the candidate's interest and strongest overall fit.
Paragraph 2: connect the most relevant demonstrated experience and capabilities to the role.
Paragraph 3: close with the value the candidate could bring and interest in a conversation.

Keep the tone professional and natural. Do not add a greeting, signoff, heading, bullets, or markdown.
</>

{% for paragraph in cover_body %}
{{ paragraph }}
{% endfor %}